  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "Thaw phyllo dough according to package instructions.",
    "Cut phyllo sheets in half lengthwise.",
    "In a bowl, mix together walnuts, sugar, cinnamon, and cloves.",
    "Brush phyllo sheets with soya milk and layer in a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
    "Repeat layering phyllo and walnut mixture until all ingredients are used up.",
    "Top with melted butter and fold phyllo sheets to create a triangle shape.",
    "Bake for 45-50 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool for 10 minutes.",
    "Drizzle with honey and serve."
